Subject: [PATCH 0003] Prism branding (app name, bundle id, icons)

Rebrands the Chromium product surface to Prism:
- theme/chromium/BRANDING: product name Prism, bundle id
  com.logibricks.prism, creator code Prsm. The GN branding plumbing
  (branding.gni -> chrome_product_full_name, chrome_mac_bundle_id) turns this
  into Prism.app + helper bundle ids without touching build files.
- chromium_strings.grd: IDS_PRODUCT_NAME / IDS_SHORT_PRODUCT_NAME shown as
  Prism (chrome://version "Product" row, menus, dialogs).
- app-Info.plist: CrProductDirName=Prism so the default user data dir becomes
  ~/Library/Application Support/Prism (chrome_paths_mac.mm).
- Icons (binary): the high-fidelity LogiBricks brand mark generated by
  chromium/branding/icons/generate_icons.py (measured geometry + 4x
  supersampling; Pillow render + iconutil + actool): mac/app.icns,
  mac/Assets.car, default_100_percent product_logo_32.png. (Refreshed
  2026-08-27 from chromium/branding/icons/out/.)

Deliberately NOT rebranded: the UA product token stays Chrome/<version>
(hardcoded in components/version_info/version_info_with_user_agent.h, so it
is untouched by this patch) for site-compatibility/anti-fraud reasons.
diff --git a/chrome/app/app-Info.plist b/chrome/app/app-Info.plist
index 6fada0a2b1..e21364ae9c 100644
--- a/chrome/app/app-Info.plist
+++ b/chrome/app/app-Info.plist
@@ -159,6 +159,8 @@
 	<string>${CHROMIUM_SHORT_NAME}</string>
 	<key>CFBundlePackageType</key>
 	<string>APPL</string>
+	<key>CrProductDirName</key>
+	<string>Prism</string>
 	<key>CFBundleSignature</key>
 	<string>${CHROMIUM_CREATOR}</string>
 	<key>NSAppleScriptEnabled</key>
diff --git a/chrome/app/chromium_strings.grd b/chrome/app/chromium_strings.grd
index 12a62d6803..d4f718ad15 100644
--- a/chrome/app/chromium_strings.grd
+++ b/chrome/app/chromium_strings.grd
@@ -294,10 +294,10 @@ If you update this file, be sure also to update google_chrome_strings.grd. -->
         </then>
         <else>
           <message name="IDS_PRODUCT_NAME" desc="The Chrome application name" translateable="false">
-            Chromium
+            Prism
           </message>
           <message name="IDS_SHORT_PRODUCT_NAME" desc="The Chrome application short name." translateable="false">
-            Chromium
+            Prism
           </message>
         </else>
       </if>
diff --git a/chrome/app/theme/chromium/BRANDING b/chrome/app/theme/chromium/BRANDING
index f8363d5b29..f586d61892 100644
--- a/chrome/app/theme/chromium/BRANDING
+++ b/chrome/app/theme/chromium/BRANDING
@@ -1,10 +1,10 @@
-COMPANY_FULLNAME=The Chromium Authors
-COMPANY_SHORTNAME=The Chromium Authors
-PRODUCT_FULLNAME=Chromium
-PRODUCT_SHORTNAME=Chromium
-PRODUCT_INSTALLER_FULLNAME=Chromium Installer
-PRODUCT_INSTALLER_SHORTNAME=Chromium Installer
-COPYRIGHT=Copyright @LASTCHANGE_YEAR@ The Chromium Authors. All rights reserved.
-MAC_BUNDLE_ID=org.chromium.Chromium
-MAC_CREATOR_CODE=Cr24
+COMPANY_FULLNAME=Logibricks
+COMPANY_SHORTNAME=Logibricks
+PRODUCT_FULLNAME=Prism
+PRODUCT_SHORTNAME=Prism
+PRODUCT_INSTALLER_FULLNAME=Prism Installer
+PRODUCT_INSTALLER_SHORTNAME=Prism Installer
+COPYRIGHT=Copyright @LASTCHANGE_YEAR@ Logibricks. All rights reserved.
+MAC_BUNDLE_ID=com.logibricks.prism
+MAC_CREATOR_CODE=Prsm
 MAC_TEAM_ID=
